{"metadata": {"team_id": "grilllab", "run_id": "grilllab-larf-finetuned", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "6-1_13", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "Microneedling vs. Mesotherapy: Which Is Better for You?\n\n**Direct Answer:**  \nGiven your oily skin, desire for visible improvement without heavy downtime, and interest in fast, effective solutions, microneedling remains the more straightforward, proven choice for overall skin texture, pore size, and rejuvenation. Mesotherapy is a strong alternative if you want targeted nourishment and hydration, but it is less about structural change and more about skin “glow.”\n\n**Key Differences & What Suits You:**\n\n- **How They Work:**\n  - **Microneedling:** Creates micro-injuries to stimulate collagen, elastin, and hyaluronic acid production. Best for acne scars, enlarged pores, fine lines, and overall skin renewal.\n  - **Mesotherapy:** Involves microinjections of a customized blend (vitamins, hyaluronic acid, peptides, antioxidants) directly into the skin’s middle layer. Focuses on hydration, pigmentation, and subtle rejuvenation.\n\n- **Results & Speed:**\n  - **Microneedling:** Noticeable improvement in texture and firmness after 2–3 weeks; best results after several sessions.\n  - **Mesotherapy:** Immediate hydration and glow, with gradual improvement in pigmentation and skin quality over multiple sessions.\n\n- **Suitability for Oily Skin:**\n  - **Microneedling:** Well-suited; helps regulate oil and shrink pores.\n  - **Mesotherapy:** Safe, but best for those seeking radiance and hydration rather than oil control.\n\n- **Downtime:**\n  - Both have minimal downtime (redness for a day or two), but mesotherapy is even gentler.\n\n- **Customization:**\n  - Mesotherapy can be tailored to target pigmentation, scarring, or hydration specifically.\n\n**Recommendation:**  \nIf your main goal is to reduce oiliness, refine pores, and improve texture, stick with microneedling. If you want an added “glow” or have stubborn pigmentation, consider adding mesotherapy.\n\nWould you like a step-by-step plan for combining both treatments, or guidance on choosing a reputable provider?", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0037-79-06507:2": -0.0925135463476181, "clueweb22-en0007-52-02413:9": -0.09845540672540665, "clueweb22-en0005-98-19840:2": -0.17996543645858765, "clueweb22-en0005-98-19840:1": -0.18781079351902008, "clueweb22-en0005-98-19840:6": -0.2660149037837982}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I use AHA BHA serum once a week.", "I use vitamin C and Retinol every day in my morning routine.", "I'm interested in treatments that improve my skin with minimal downtime.", "I usually wear makeup to even out my complexion.", "I apply Hyaluronic Acid two times a day after washing my face.", "I've noticed dark spots and uneven tone on my face.", "I have visible pores on my cheeks and nose."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0037-79-06507:2": -0.0925135463476181, "clueweb22-en0007-52-02413:9": -0.09845540672540665, "clueweb22-en0005-98-19840:2": -0.17996543645858765, "clueweb22-en0005-98-19840:1": -0.18781079351902008, "clueweb22-en0005-98-19840:6": -0.2660149037837982, "clueweb22-en0014-30-12480:8": -0.32829055190086365, "clueweb22-en0020-68-08676:4": -0.5156538486480713, "clueweb22-en0005-98-19840:5": -0.6268725991249084, "clueweb22-en0017-69-06314:0": -0.696264922618866, "clueweb22-en0038-72-02313:5": -0.785132646560669, "clueweb22-en0027-29-01748:10": -0.8004088997840881, "clueweb22-en0019-24-02399:5": -0.9370863437652588, "clueweb22-en0010-79-08092:8": -0.9843521118164062, "clueweb22-en0012-49-09099:0": -1.1437548398971558, "clueweb22-en0044-86-11559:2": -1.1965231895446777, "clueweb22-en0005-98-19840:8": -1.324635624885559, "clueweb22-en0005-98-19840:4": -1.4434962272644043, "clueweb22-en0000-96-07244:6": -1.61979341506958, "clueweb22-en0016-80-15701:7": -1.6437875032424927, "clueweb22-en0005-52-08775:1": -1.665366530418396, "clueweb22-en0005-52-08775:0": -1.7328619956970215, "clueweb22-en0009-67-17389:4": -1.81118