{"metadata": {"team_id": "grilllab", "run_id": "grilllab-larf-finetuned", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "8-2_6", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "REACH is an EU regulation that stands for Registration, Evaluation, Authorization, and Restriction of Chemicals. For tattooing, this means:\n\n- **Purpose:** REACH is designed to protect people and the environment from harmful chemicals, including those found in tattoo inks.\n- **Impact on Tattoo Supplies:** Since January 2022, many tattoo inks—especially colored ones—have been banned or restricted in the EU (including Germany) if they contain substances linked to allergies, genetic mutations, or cancer.\n- **What This Means for You:** When shopping for tattoo needles, inks, or other supplies, look for products labeled as \"REACH compliant.\" This ensures they meet strict EU safety standards and do not contain banned chemicals.\n- **Why It Matters:** Even if you’re only practicing on fake skin, using REACH-compliant products is safer and prepares you for working on real skin in the future.\n\n**For your hobbyist setup:** Stick to reputable tattoo supply shops that clearly state their products are REACH compliant. Avoid general marketplaces where compliance and safety can’t be guaranteed.\n\nWould you like recommendations for specific REACH-compliant brands or shops that ship to Germany?", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0000-83-16967:1": -0.01243610680103302, "clueweb22-en0000-83-16967:2": -0.016646651551127434, "clueweb22-en0007-89-03397:0": -0.017236905172467232, "clueweb22-en0033-74-18753:0": -0.017236905172467232, "clueweb22-en0007-89-03397:1": -0.017567040398716927}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I have a sedentary lifestyle.", "I live in Germany.", "I can draw well.", "I work in an office."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0000-83-16967:1": -0.01243610680103302, "clueweb22-en0000-83-16967:2": -0.016646651551127434, "clueweb22-en0007-89-03397:0": -0.017236905172467232, "clueweb22-en0033-74-18753:0": -0.017236905172467232, "